<title>BELGIUM: EU beef intervention down.</title>
<headline>EU beef intervention down.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's beef intervention purchases were again down at Friday's beef management committee, an Commission official said.</p>
<p>&quot;Only 11,033 tonnes were accepted into intervention showing that the recovery of the market is continuing,&quot; the offcial added.</p>
<p>A maximum price of 273 ecus per 100 kg was set for category A and for Category C.</p>
</text>
